locking":0},"body":"### Describe the bug\n\nThe parameter `annotations` when MessageBodyReader.isReadable is invoked is always null.\n\n### Expected behavior\n\nThe parameter `annotations` when MessageBodyReader.isReadable is invoked is never null.\r\n\r\n- `annotations` is an empty array in the case when the method which was invoked in the proxy interface isn't annotated.\r\n- `annotations` contains all annotations of the invoked proxy client interface method\r\n\n\n### Actual behavior\n\nThe parameter `annotations` is always null.\n\n### How to Reproduce?\n\nReproducer: https://github.com/mkonzal/quarkus-reactive-message-body-reader-annotations.git\r\n\r\nGET /service/main or GET /service/sub/xyz\n\n### Output of `uname -a` or `ver`\n\n_No response_\n\n### Output of `java -version`\n\nopenjdk version \"11.0.12\" 2021-07-20 LTS\n\n### GraalVM version (if different from Java)\n\n_No response_\n\n### Quarkus version or git rev\n\n2.2.1\n\n### Build tool (ie. output of `mvnw --version` or `gradlew --version`)\n\nApache Maven 3.8.1 (05c21c65bdfed0f71a2f2ada8b84da59348c4c5d)\n\n### Additional information\n\n_No response_","closed_by":{"login":"geoand","id":4374975,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNzQ5NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4374975?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/geoand","html_url":"https://github.com/geoand","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geoand/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geoand/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geoand/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geoand/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geoand/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geoand/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geoand/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geoand/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geoand/received_events","typ